00:47:18.092 --> 00:47:22.596
Jangan membeli
peralatan multiguna buatan Cina.

00:47:23.597 --> 00:47:26.517
Aku mencoba mencari
pisau Swiss Army-ku,

00:47:26.934 --> 00:47:29.478
