00:56:41.279 --> 00:56:43.323
Tepuk tangan untuk Aron!

00:56:44.825 --> 00:56:45.951
Hei.

00:56:46.034 --> 00:56:47.953
Hai.

00:56:48.036 --> 00:56:51.331
